    "What is your relationship with mathematics?": "I have a complicated relationship with mathematics. While I recognize its importance, especially in fields like computer science that interest me, I often find it challenging and frustrating. My parents didn't prioritize education, so I had to work harder than my peers to keep up. Despite this, I admire the logic and structure of math, even if I struggle with its abstract nature.",
